{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bc9587d402d663a8","type":"text","text":"Create New project\n![[Pasted image 20231225153658.png]]","x":-260,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fbc11c419c26892f","type":"text","text":"Choose Video\n![[Pasted image 20231225153844.png]]","x":-260,"y":-40,"width":250,"height":219,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6dda0a616351cd59","type":"text","text":"Drag/Drop Video Files into Window\n![[Pasted image 20231225154032.png]]","x":-260,"y":240,"width":250,"height":400,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"aa44956840bce99c","type":"text","text":"# Phase 1: Import File","x":-260,"y":-440,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"0ff89e9918886bfa","type":"text","text":"# Phase 2: Create the Sequence","x":40,"y":-449,"width":250,"height":129,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"8a9404471e245ec4","type":"text","text":"Transcribe File(s)\n![[Pasted image 20231225154552.png]]","x":40,"y":-245,"width":250,"height":331,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c6e6abf7fd6bd33e","type":"text","text":"Keep going.\n![[Pasted image 20231225154654.png]]","x":43,"y":122,"width":250,"height":178,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"331b1ceabbc1a541","type":"text","text":"Identify the Speaker\n![[Pasted image 20231225154737.png]]","x":43,"y":410,"width":250,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"30f012f7ebdbd9cd","type":"text","text":"# Phase 4: Enable Settings","x":880,"y":-449,"width":250,"height":129,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c8fbe246989dd15e","type":"text","text":"Insert the Sequence into the Script\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225160138.png]]","x":880,"y":-262,"width":250,"height":384,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b842dcd1cce2da5e","type":"text","text":"Click Speaker's video on the Canvas \n![[Pasted image 20231225160550.png]]\n\nHere you can:\n- Position the video\n- Change the shape (square, rectangle, circle)\n- Crop\n- Zoom\n- Rotate\n- Flip\n- Other Options","x":880,"y":220,"width":250,"height":520,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e937556559e0f7d9","type":"text","text":"## Optional: Layering","x":1260,"y":540,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"a525f9a42f632adb","type":"text","text":"Right Click asset you would like to change layer and highlight \"layer order\"\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225161142.png]]","x":1260,"y":660,"width":250,"height":420},
		{"id":"e2b8d2b8c67766c7","type":"text","text":"Change Layer order or use hotkeys\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225161314.png]]","x":1260,"y":1140,"width":250,"height":223},
		{"id":"5e7358ca445e4f35","type":"text","text":"## Optional: Remove Filler words","x":860,"y":831,"width":250,"height":129},
		{"id":"d1236849e5d0add8","type":"text","text":"Click Actions\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225161500.png]]","x":860,"y":1011,"width":250,"height":289},
		{"id":"0e2527efec7e9f60","type":"text","text":"Click Remove Filler Words\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225161601.png]]","x":860,"y":1363,"width":250,"height":337},
		{"id":"9cd5843906e7c707","type":"text","text":"Click the Dropdown, choose Ignore, hit Remove All\n\n![[Pasted image 20231225161710.png]]","x":860,"y":1740,"width":250,"height":260},
		{"id":"5886735d337e59dc","type":"text","text":"Highlight all Speakers (Click, CTRL, Click)\n![[Pasted image 20231225155229.png]]","x":220,"y":708,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"f54b35997b2d01e2","type":"text","text":"Create Sequence (multiple ways)\n![[Pasted image 20231225155148.png]]","x":220,"y":960,"width":250,"height":334,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4b89f570659b7b3c","type":"text","text":"Turn on Studio Sound\n![[Pasted image 20231225155425.png]]","x":220,"y":1403,"width":250,"height":342,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ab67a0e013cd32ce","type":"text","text":"Make sure videos are lined up correctly\n![[Pasted image 20231225155731.png]]","x":220,"y":1883,"width":250,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"3aa2ea44b3321894","type":"text","text":"Click Done - now the videos can be treated as one, but are still separate. This is important if you have a background, or something that might affect changing times on other tracks.","x":220,"y":2219,"width":250,"height":224,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bfcbf83eb86893f9","type":"text","text":"## Optional: Green Screen\n![[Pasted image 20231225160527.png]]\n\nFlip on Green Screen if you want to remove the background from the video.","x":1300,"y":0,"width":250,"height":383},
		{"id":"e4cb819f368768c8","type":"text","text":"Click on the Speaker\n![[Pasted image 20231225162336.png]]\n","x":-135,"y":708,"width":250,"height":195,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"55717d20809e6e59","type":"text","text":"Turn on Studio Sound\n![[Pasted image 20231225162408.png]]\n","x":-135,"y":1000,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"2"}
	],
